title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1, CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD=none): no card at all: the no sound input page, REC dimmed, no CARD stepper
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD none
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1200
expect text "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect notext "CARD"
shot noinput
tap "REC"
wait 500
expect text "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
